{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multiprofile multimodal setup using PCA and ResNet50 encoders with concat fusion, aiming to compare its performance against avgpool aggregation (config_004). Validation accuracy of 0.5793 and F1 of 0.5631 are lower than the avgpool baseline (0.6186 accuracy, 0.6103 F1), suggesting potential limitations of transformer aggregation in this configuration. The exact contribution of aggregation method versus other design choices remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
}

